(15 de outubro, 22:00) parte a prova rainha <strong>UTAX \u2013 Ultra Trail das Aldeias do Xisto (103 km)<\/strong>; no s\u00e1bado (16 de outubro) disputam-se a <strong>Final Europeia da ITRA National League (54 km, 08:30)<\/strong> e o <strong>TSL \u2013 Trail Serra da Lous\u00e3 (54 km, 09:00)<\/strong>; e no domingo (17 de outubro) realizam-se o <strong>TX \u2013 Trail do Xisto (33 km, 09:00)<\/strong>, o <strong>AXtrail Kids (09:15)<\/strong>, o <strong>MTX \u2013 Mini Trail do Xisto (16 km, 10:00)<\/strong> e a caminhada <strong>Caminho do Xisto (8 km, 10:15)<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal personalizado com chip, lembran\u00e7a oficial, pr\u00e9mio Finisher, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos (com saco de base de vida interm\u00e9dia no UTAX), refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova, banhos, solo duro e seguro desportivo. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: c