;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">CX \u2013 Caminhada Caminho do Xisto (8 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Outubro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Per\u00edodo Promocional:<\/strong> 10,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Per\u00edodo Inicial:<\/strong> 15,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Per\u00edodo Regular:<\/strong> 17,50\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o AXTrail 2027 (UTAX)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do AXTrail (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do UTAX \u2013 Ultra Trail das Aldeias do Xisto) decorre nos dias 15, 16 e 17 de Outubro de 2027, com centro de evento na Pra\u00e7a da Notabilidade, em Castanheira de Pera (Leiria).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na sexta-feira (15 de outubro) \u00e0s 22:00 parte o UTAX (103 km, limite de 28 horas). No s\u00e1bado (16 de outubro) partem a Final Europeia da ITRA National League (54 km, 08:30) e o TSL \u2013 Trail Serra da Lous\u00e3 (54 km, 09:00, limite de 17 horas). No domingo (17 de outubro) realizam-se o TX \u2013 Trail do Xisto (33 km, 09:00, limite de 8 horas), o AXtrail Kids (09:15), o MTX \u2013 Mini Trail do Xisto (16 km, 10:00, limite de 4 horas) e a caminhada Caminho do Xisto (8 km, 10:15).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do AXTrail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No Per\u00edodo Inicial (de 2 de novembro a 31 de dezembro de 2026), os valores s\u00e3o: UTAX 100\u20ac, TSL 50\u20ac, TX 30\u20ac, MTX 20\u20ac e Caminhada 15\u20ac. No Per\u00edodo Regular (de 1 de janeiro a 1 de outubro de 2027), os valores passam para: UTAX 115\u20ac, TSL 60\u20ac, TX 40\u20ac, MTX 25\u20ac e Caminhada 17,50\u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castanheira de Pera na sexta-feira (15 de outubro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 22:00, no s\u00e1bado (16 de outubro) das 07:00 \u00e0s 20:00, e no domingo (17 de outubro) das 07:00 \u00e0s 10:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e h\u00e1 base de vida no UTAX?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado com chip, lembran\u00e7a oficial, pr\u00e9mio de Finisher, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova, Pasta Party (UTAX, sexta \u00e0s 19:00 na UTAX Arena), duche, solo duro e seguro desportivo. Os atletas do UTAX (103 km) disp\u00f5em de envio de saco para a base de vida localizada a meio do percurso.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"AXTrail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-10-15\", \"endDate\": \"2027-10-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a da Notabilidade, Castanheira de Pera\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Castanheira de Pera\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O AXTrail 2027 (UTAX) realiza-se de 15 a 17 de outubro em Castanheira de Pera. Ultra Trail de 103 km e 54 km, Trail 33 km e 16 km e Caminhada 8 km.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-axtrail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"UTAX \u2013 Ultra Trail das Aldeias do Xisto (103 km)\", \"price\": \"80.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/utax-axtrail2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TSL \u2013 Trail Serra da Lous\u00e3 & Final Europeia ITRA NL (54 km)\", \"price\": \"35.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/utax-axtrail2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TX \u2013 Trail do Xisto (33 km)\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https: